<title>GREECE: GREEK BANKS EXPECTED TO QUOTE ATHIBOR RATES.</title>
<headline>GREEK BANKS EXPECTED TO QUOTE ATHIBOR RATES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek Athibor rates will be available at 15:30 local as several banks have agreed to feed quotes manually, Spyros Pantelias, an official at the Hellenic Banks Association (HBA) told Reuters.</p>
<p>A minimum of nine banks must quote prices for the system to calculate averages.</p>
<p>Most Greek banks refused to quote rates earlier on Tuesday following confusion and uncertainty over reports of a government plan to tax interbank depos.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
